From: =?UTF-8?q?Ege=20Co=C5=9Fkun?= <randward@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 21:45:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 21/33] ASoC: qcom: sm8250: Set the codec TDM slots on the
 primary TDM link

Tell the codecs about the 32 bit slots and alternate them between the
left and right channel slots.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
index 040ad42a2..62fdbf1f9 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
@@ -192,6 +192,8 @@ static int sm8250_snd_startup(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream)
 			TDM_BCLK_RATE, SNDRV_PCM_STREAM_PLAYBACK);
 
 		for_each_rtd_codec_dais(rtd, j, codec_dai) {
+			/* 32 bit slots, codecs listed as left, right, left, right */
+			snd_soc_dai_set_tdm_slot(codec_dai, 0, BIT(j % 2), 8, 32);
 			ret = snd_soc_dai_set_fmt(codec_dai, codec_dai_fmt);
 			snd_soc_dai_set_sysclk(codec_dai, 0, TDM_BCLK_RATE, SNDRV_PCM_STREAM_PLAYBACK);
 			/* The PLL reference of codecs like CS35L41 is set on the component */
